.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-06-12", "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "2026_06_12_v2_graph_spine_and_literal_matching_literal_matching_pipeline", "norm_label": "literal-matching pipeline: exact+normalization pre-pass, vocab-free interpreter type/wanted-vs-excluded flag, scoped distance lookup on miss, paraphrase to semantics"}, {"label": "No corpus vocabulary in the interpreter's context (cost boundary; deterministic resolution is free)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-12-v2-graph-spine-and-literal-matching.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-06-12", "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "2026_06_12_v2_graph_spine_and_literal_matching_no_corpus_vocab_in_interpreter", "norm_label": "no corpus vocabulary in the interpreter's context (cost boundary; deterministic resolution is free)"}, {"label": "Ambiguity rule: all candidates boosted, confidence tiers boost size, jump only on exact-unique single anchor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-12-v2-graph-spine-and-literal-matching.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-06-12", "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "2026_06_12_v2_graph_spine_and_literal_matching_ambiguity_rule", "norm_label": "ambiguity rule: all candidates boosted, confidence tiers boost size, jump only on exact-unique single anchor"}, {"label": "Multi-hit rule: multiple hard-field hits = additive boosts only, no multi-anchor jump", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-12-v2-graph-spine-and-literal-matching.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": "2026-06-12", "author": null, "contributor": null, "id": "2026_06_12_v2_graph_spine_and_literal_matching_multi_hit_boosts_only", "norm_label": "multi-hit rule: multiple hard-field hits = additive boosts only, no multi-anchor jump"}, {"label": "Field handling follows value shape (dates to time-range,